  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.makeship.com%252fpetitions%252fstarbuncle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/401955/description_ff2c6b7c-4f00-45e1-8197-3ee04ed7cfac.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"160\"></a></p><p> </p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/401955/description_6f6e55e4-d1c2-4e5c-8eee-356da3fda062.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"155\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Ars Nouveau 是一款受 Ars Magicka 启发的魔法模组，允许玩家自定义法术、创造魔法物品、进行仪式以及更多内容。完整文档由 Patchouli 在游戏中提供。要开始使用此模组，请用一本书和 1 个青金石制作“旧笔记”。你也可以参考下面的 Wiki。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.arsnouveau.wiki%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>https://www.arsnouveau.wiki/</strong></span></a></span></p><p> </p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>引入自定义法术制作——随时构建符合你需求的法术！</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>制作强大的新饰品与小物件。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>为魔法机器提供动力。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>用可爱的魔法仆从实现基地自动化！</strong></span></li>\n</ul><hr><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:24px\"><strong>在寻找整合包？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>试试 Arcane Isles！一个基于 Ars Nouveau 和 Hex Casting 的空岛整合包。</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/arcane-isles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/arcane-isles</a></strong></span></p><p> </p><hr><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>加入社区！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>加入 Discord 获取帮助，与其他巫师交流！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/y7TMXZu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>https://discord.gg/y7TMXZu</strong></span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/y7TMXZu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/743298050222587978/widget.png?style=banner2\" width=\"300\" height=\"160\"></a></strong></span></p><p> </p><hr><p> </p><p><strong style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:24px\">支持模组</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>要支持本模组，请访问我们的 Redbubble 商店，购买 Ars Nouveau 周边产品！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.redbubble.com%252fpeople%252fGootastic%252fshop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>https://www.redbubble.com/people/Gootastic/shop</strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>你也可以通过 Patreon 支持我们！我们的 Patreon 奖励等级包括 Discord 身份组，以及提交新法术书创意（可在地牢战利品中获得）的功能！订阅期间还能获得周边物品！Patreon 成员还可进入 Discord 私有服务器。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/arsnouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/arsnouveau</a></span></p><p> </p><hr><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>依赖模组</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Curios</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Patchouli</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Geckolib 3.0（适用于 Minecraft 1.16.0 及以上版本）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Geckolib 2.0（适用于 1.15 以上但低于 1.16.0 的 Minecraft 版本）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Terrablender（可选依赖，用于在 Minecraft 1.19+ 版本中启用古木森林群系）</strong></span></li>\n</ul><hr><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>法术制作</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>随时自定义你的法术！</strong></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lgQ3x4-FWFw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p> </p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>仪式</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>施放持续影响区域的强力法术！</strong></span><br><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IG-lTfAPVCQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"> </p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>魔法助手</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>召唤各种魔法生物来协助自动化！</strong></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z1IT__CtCQs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p> </p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>制作与附魔物品</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>制作强大物品或附魔你的装备！<br></strong></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rcnhISDnlZ8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p> </p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>评测与游戏实况</strong></span></p><p><strong style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EPlrqmtnTuk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">在寻找附属模组？</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Creo 由 Ars Nouveau 团队制作 - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">为法术炮塔、源质罐等添加与 Create 模组的兼容性！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-creo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-creo</span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong> </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Too Many Glyphs 由 DerringerCubed 制作 - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">添加多种新魔符，包括过滤器、特殊形态以及独特的施法目标/咒符操作魔符。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/too-many-glyphs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/too-many-glyphs</a> </span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong> </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars EnderStorage 由 MoonWolf 制作 - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Nouveau 与 Enderstorage 的桥梁，允许你随时访问末影存储，在箱子里存取方块，并显示魔力数值。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-enderstorage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-enderstorage</a> </span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong> </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Elemental 由 Alexthw 制作 - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">为风、土、火、水四系添加 4 个新的法术聚能核心，以及一个被腐化的召唤聚能核心，使召唤物变得更为阴森。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental-elemental-spell-foci\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental-elemental-spell-foci</a> </span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong> </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Scalaes 由 Alexthw 制作 - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">添加多项跨模组兼容，包括 Pekhui、ProjectMMO 和 Scaling Health。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-scalaes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-scalaes</span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong> </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Arsenal 由 ToxicMintTea 制作 - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">扩展护甲选项，包括元素法师长袍和板甲，可提供折扣、增强效果以及独特的隐藏增益。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-arsenal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-arsenal</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong> </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Tome of Blood 由 ToxicMintTea 制作 - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">通过特殊魔符和消耗生命点数（LP）的物品与法术，集成 Ars Nouveau 与 Blood Magic！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tome-of-blood\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tome-of-blood</span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong> </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Instrumentum 由 Sarenor 制作 - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">一系列提升生活质量的物品与配方，用于存储/粘贴星宝可梦、中继器、切换装备等！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-instrumentum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-instrumentum</span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong> </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Omega 由 dkmk100_ludum_dare 制作 - 极大地扩展了 Ars Nouveau 的能力上限，添加了强力新魔符、方块、仪式、维度等。</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-omega\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-omega</span></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong> </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Zettai Ars 由 ZettaSword 制作 - 一个跨界模组，整合了 Ars Nouveau、Mana and Artifice 与 PlayerEx！</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zettai-ars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zettai-ars</span></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KqNBPc.mp4\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>寻找其他模组？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>试试 BlockPrints！这是一个蓝图分享和下载平台：<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-prints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-prints</a></span></strong></span></p>",
